<title>GERMANY: VIAG says 96 pre-tax profit up about 5 pct.</title>
<headline>VIAG says 96 pre-tax profit up about 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   1,060   vs 1,320</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     2,350   vs 2,241</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified utility is VIAG AG. More information is expected to be released at a news conference.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
